        }
      ],
      "text_preview": "As the respondents have acted in gross violation of the Act, only to pressurise the petitioner and his Abhijit Saikia vs The State Of Assam And 3 Ors on 19 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/181004357/\n3 family members "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e87ded41598741c082f28dc05939f9a4_56",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It cannot be dismissed at this juncture that no case u/s 420 or 468 lies against the present petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "200cbd96701847ba88b6834ed51261bd_64",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It would also be pertinent to mention that the power of attachment and forfeiture is given to courts and not to police officer."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0bbe2d97fe384b2da226571497502173_65",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As pointed out in the judgment of my learned brother, if a police officer is given the power to seize immovable property it may lead to an absolutely chaotic situation."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a5304a4f5bda4b2c82486c96ff786273_66",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "To give an example, if there is a physical fight between the landlord and the tenant over the rented premises and if the version of the appellant is to be accepted, the police official would be entitled to seize the tenanted property."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c03b6411b848428bbafb40d18ec752c4_67",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This would make a mockery of rent laws."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "277a05800cc14842bbadfe92fc49e88c_68",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "To give another example, if a person forges a will and thereby claims property on the basis of the forged will, can Abhijit Saikia vs The State Of Assam And 3 Ors on 19 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/181004357/\n4 th"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bd5e4009ffd94eb3a7d824f5e01c4f0b_69",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The answer has to be in the negative."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "39eb6aa2ef0f4ebab52097760be13af0_70",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nOtherwise it would lead to an absurd situation which could never have been envisaged by the Legislature."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "02962cdf728f414fbd2b070d33e74816_71",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The power of seizure in Section 102 has to be limited to movable property."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f6d8c30e587449828200a9b9136644f9_72",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As far as the meaning of property in Section 452 of the Cr.P.C. is concerned, that is not a question referred to the larger Bench and therefore, I would refrain from saying anything about that."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d68501fecbd54495a70823f3f6d13759_73",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In view of the above, I would answer the reference by holding that the phrase 'any property' in Section 102 will only cover moveable property and not immovable property.\""
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6de6a75e425347bca8820c4cccde6f30_74",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nPage No.# 9/10 13."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0562df8976254056aa7af0d95411c3b6_75",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In the instant case the IO has sent a report as called for by the learned Addl. PP."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "39b271c03f9042f0b2637e53cf63be43_76",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The report reflects that the cold storage has been seized and sealed in connection with this case with allegations of using the cold storage to store beef and to supply the same to various hotels and restaurants violating the provisions of "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2c68d2531d6e477489c25468eecfbba7_77",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is also reflected through the report that the cold storage is also used to store paneer, pop corn, chicken etc. together with the beef."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4a24210e61b049f6b14e88de56541cb6_78",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "I have also considered the submissions that the articles stored in the cold storage are perishable articles and they may get damaged."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "11fa28267fc64a17b91f0da334bb8b75_79",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It has to be borne in mind that the cold storage is an immovable property."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "88093573987746339ed44d2f87663b17_80",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In the light of the decision of the Hon'ble Supreme Court in Nevada Properties Private Ltd. (supra), it is held that the police officer has no jurisdiction to seize, seal and lock the cold storage which is an immovable property."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7362b81531e24176ad7a50821c8aa5ac_81",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
